  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Australia, the ICRC fosters support for our global operations and promotes international humanitarian law and universal humanitarian principles. Overview of activities in Australia The ICRC&apos;s Suva delegation promotes international humanitarian law and raises other humanitarian issues with governments, security forces, academic circles, the media and civil society. We help communities affected by conflict, visit detainees and support the region&apos;s National Societies.</narrative>
  </description>
